      "image_path": "res://assets/images/act1_p01_overlook.png",
      "story_text": "Jordan knelt on the jagged cliff. Below him, the Fire Clan village glowed like a bed of angry embers. It had taken years of searching, but he had finally found them.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Continue",
          "next_page_id": "act1_p02_eyes",
          "effects": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_id": "act1_p02_eyes",
      "act_id": "act_1",
      "image_path": "res://assets/images/act1_p02_eyes.png",
      "story_text": "He narrowed his eyes as the wind kicked up hot ash. The scent of woodsmoke filled the air. To anyone else, it was just a fire, but to Jordan, it was the smell of the night his world ended.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Remember",
          "next_page_id": "act1_p03_flashback",
          "effects": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_id": "act1_p03_flashback",
      "act_id": "act_1",
      "image_path": "res://assets/images/act1_p03_flashback.png",
      "story_text": "The orange glow in his eyes blurred into a memory of his own home. He saw the red banners of the Fire Clan waving through the sparks. He saw his people scattered and his village turned to gray dust.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Continue",
          "next_page_id": "act1_p04_ash",
          "effects": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_id": "act1_p04_ash",
      "act_id": "act_1",
      "image_path": "res://assets/images/act1_p04_ash.png",
      "story_text": "A younger Jordan knelt in the ruins of his home. The heat was unbearable, but his heart felt cold. In that moment, surrounded by smoke, he made a silent promise to find the people who did this.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "The Vow",
          "next_page_id": "act1_p05_vow",
          "effects": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
