      "act_id": "act_1",
      "image_path": "res://assets/images/act1_p05_vow.png",
      "story_text": "Jordan stood up from the ash. He knew that to get justice, he could not stay a frightened child. He sought out a mysterious hermit living in the frozen peaks\u2014a man who had been exiled from the Fire Clan long ago.",
